## ClickFlash Planning Artifacts

When building implementation plans for ClickFlash, use the following artifact structure:

# 	ask.md (Living Checklist)
Break down the implementation into atomic steps. Group them by Turborepo app/package:
- [ ] packages/types: Update contracts
- [ ] pps/backend/cloud-backend: Implement edge route
- [ ] pps/desktop/master: Update ingest logic

# implementation_plan.md (Design Document)
Structure your proposed changes clearly. Highlight any risks to the V6.0 Invariants:
1. Does this add UI bloat to the Headless Master? (WARNING if yes)
2. Does this rely on QR codes instead of Biometrics? (CAUTION if yes)
3. Does this bypass the SQLite queue? (WARNING if yes)

# walkthrough.md (Final Summary)
Always include the output of 
pm run typecheck:all to prove the invariant was upheld before closing the task.
